  <div class="services-hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Wall clock styled for a modern office interior"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Modern workplace interior for business wall clock supply" fetchpriority="high"><div class="services-hero-art-card"><span>FOR BUSINESS BUYERS</span><strong>One catalogue.<br>Multiple ways to buy.</strong><small>Retail · Bulk · Custom</small></div></div>
